>
> I can live with this, but I'd prefer to ban it altogether.
>
>
> It depends on in what way should it be banned.
> I vote for banning it from the formal grammar however, I vote for the
> preprocessor to be able to autocorrect {jie} back to {ji'e}. Speech
> recognition must be able to recognize both variants.
>
>
